-iPhone","line":23},{"title":"Adding support for Tap to Pay on iPhone to your app","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ProximityReader/adding-support-for-tap-to-pay-on-iphone-to-your-app#Display-the-Terms-and-Conditions-interface-to-the-merchant","line":25},{"title":"in-app messaging","target":"https://developer.apple.com/tap-to-pay/marketing-guidelines/#in-your-app","line":27},{"title":"An illustration of an app screen that describes the feature and contains a button labeled 'Enable Tap to Pay on iPhone'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a41cd2da2fc8940033e2ea6b75606197/tap-to-pay-introduction-screen%402x.png","line":29,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an app screen that contains a button labeled 'Try a test transaction'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/3b8b8486581947e539f4acee1007fba4/tap-to-pay-confirmation-screen%402x.png","line":31,"embedded":true},{"title":"Educating merchants","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/tap-to-pay-on-iphone#Educating-merchants","line":37},{"title":"`ProximityReaderDiscovery`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ProximityReader/ProximityReaderDiscovery","line":54},{"title":"Tap to Pay on iPhone marketing guidelines","target":"https://developer.apple.com/tap-to-pay/marketing-guidelines/","line":54},{"title":"An illustration of an app's Tutorials screen in Settings, with a link to open the merchant education tutorial experience.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6e4f01e90092b71a1a173c0bdf4c9726/tap-to-pay-merchant-settings-tutorials%402x.png","line":56,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of the Tap to Pay on iPhone merchant education tutorial sheet, which includes an image of the Tap to Pay behavior and instructions for how to accept a first payment.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e5bab425805217aa9d34d7107b751d75/tap-to-pay-merchant-educa