rmed-payment%402x.png","line":138,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an app's checkout screen showing a red X in a red circle above a purchase total. Below the total is the text 'Select receipt option' followed by a stack of three buttons.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0afbca661875947cdc85284e89322a98/tap-to-pay-unconfirmed-payment%402x.png","line":140,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an app's checkout screen showing a red X in a red circle above the text 'Payment not completed' followed by a purchase total. Below the total is the text 'Select payment option' followed by four buttons, including Tap to Pay on iPhone.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4e43882f08c5c4e7203d0ef0dcf25415/tap-to-pay-unsuccessful-transaction%402x.png","line":153,"embedded":true},{"title":"alert","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/alerts","line":164},{"title":"`PaymentCardReaderSession.ReadError`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ProximityReader/PaymentCardReaderSession/ReadError","line":164},{"title":"Additional interactions","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/tap-to-pay-on-iphone#Additional-interactions","line":168},{"title":"An illustration of a button labeled 'Loyalty Card'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e586a72bca99cdaa8c68fb4b99c8e209/loyalty-card%402x.png","line":178,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":180,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a button labeled 'Tap to Pay on iPhone - Loyalty'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/72070690d8e7d35c7c79169e018faa39/tap-to-pay-on-iphone-loyalty%402x.png","line":182,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target